---
// Digital Twin: 3-axis industrial robot pick-and-place cell.
// REAL IK ANIMATION — θ1/θ2 solved analytically every frame from the
// interpolated wrist target, so the gripper lands exactly on PICK/PLACE.
// Elbow-UP solution is always selected → high arc, ground clearance enforced.
// SVG arm: drawn pointing UP (-Y). +Y down in the SVG frame.
// Hierarchy: J1(base) → arm1(L1=80) → J2(elbow) → arm2(L2=65) → gripper(L3=14)
//
// MOTION PROFILE — chained phases, one global s-curve each (TOTAL = 9.0 s):
//   HOLD HOME(0.7s) → CHAIN to PICK(1.9s) → HOLD PICK+grip(0.4s)
//   → CHAIN to apex T_B(1.6s) → CHAIN apex→PLACE(1.6s)
//   → HOLD PLACE+release(0.4s) → CHAIN back to HOME(1.9s) → HOLD HOME(0.5s)
// Each CHAIN traverses its polyline under one cumulative-distance quintic
// smoothstep: starts from rest, cruises through intermediate points, and
// decelerates onto its end target. The transfer arc is split at T_B — the
// straight-arm apex where both IK branches meet — so that singular
// configuration is crossed at rest (no elbow whip, no branch flip).
//
// MULTI-MOUNT SAFETY — the page mounts this component twice (Systems +
// CaseStudies) with identical inner ids. The bundled script never uses global
// getElementById; it locates every instance via [data-rpp] and queries each
// mount's own subtree, so both robots animate independently.
//
// IK model (validated numerically): base (215,232), GROUND_Y=255, L1=80, L2=65.
//   D   = hypot(tx-BX, ty-BY)
//   t2  = acos((D² - L1² - L2²) / (2·L1·L2))            (± branch)
//   t1  = atan2(dy,dx) - atan2(L2·sin t2, L1+L2·cos t2)
// Applied to SVG rotate(): θ1_rot = t1 + 90° (arm1 drawn along -Y), θ2_rot = t2.
// Elbow-UP ⇒ keep the solution with the smaller elbow y (min ground distance).
// Verified: all targets reachable, min floor clearance 63.7px, cycle returns to
// a bit-identical HOME pose (apex where both branches merge → no branch flip).
const font = "ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Cascadia Mono, Consolas, monospace";
---

<div class="rpp-wrapper" data-rpp role="img" aria-label="3-axis industrial robot pick and place simulation">
<svg
  id="rpp-svg"
  viewBox="0 0 640 360"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  class="block aspect-[16/9] h-auto w-full transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03]"
  font-family={font}
>
